Third-party source used by the BENSON Android foreground service

The files under src/main/cpp and MicroWakeWordInference.kt are adapted from the
Home Assistant Android Companion App, module android/microwakeword, commit
b3db6a862c78263b72c8759209d0f24da7185407, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
